 "_comment": "Topic art for the Pinterest daily drip (owner-approved 6 Nov 2026: \"approve all, make them good\"). Every page that gets pins maps to ONE topic; a pin may only use its topic's images, and scripts/pinterest/quality.mjs holds any pin whose art is not its page's topic. Photos are CC0 / public domain, or the free Unsplash or Pexels licence (never Unsplash+ or paid stock) (licence, creator and source recorded per image, found through the Openverse API on 6 Nov 2026, resized into public/pinterest/topic-art/); product art is this site's own. No identifiable people, no couples (design system). A new page with no topic here gets no pins until one is added (PIN_QUALITY_HOLD names it). pages.<path>.search: the searches the page answers (its own title and its board's Pinterest searches, data/pinterest/boards.json keywords); a pin headline must name one of them.",
